2478d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0fd72d277a2fe0828ffac96169dfff8b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/31000507/uploads/origins/f8d40a7b-a7bd-4ec6-900d-72be1032478d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0fd72d277a2fe0828ffac96169dfff8b, https://si.imgix.net/31000507/uploads/origins/f8d40a7b-a7bd-4ec6-900d-72be1032478d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a0e639cd27a52708855fee719ef58448 2x, https://si.imgix.net/31000507/uploads/origins/f8d40a7b-a7bd-4ec6-900d-72be1032478d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e05d21d14f0944c10c25fc547e0c742e 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!! My name is Yuri Otohana, a VTuber.\nI was so charmed by Usushio-sensei’s illustrations that I reached out to request a commission. \n  \n[Details]  \nI’d like you to draw an illustration of VTuber Yuri Otohana, including the background.\n Reference URL: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1t7JE6_ng3TrCctgeRN07m5msE0KRi0r2?usp=share_link \n X: https://x.com/otohanayuuri\n Since I plan to use this for thumbnails and similar purposes, I’d appreciate a composition where her face is visible.\nOtherwise, I’d like to leave the composition up to you!  \n\n[Intended Use]\nI’ll use it for YouTube thumbnails, Twitter posts, and similar purposes.\n*I’ll be sure to credit your name and X account when using the artwork! \n\n[Delivery Format] \nIt would be very helpful if you could provide two files: a PSD file with the background and character separated, and a PNG or JPEG file.  Thank you in advance!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1t7JE6_ng3TrCctgeRN07m5msE0KRi0r2?usp=share_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@USUMENO_/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1130888, "client_id": 1986708, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56a3297fc87f40250295dc3d49709728", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56a3297fc87f40250295dc3d49709728, https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=630df60833ddfd8dc49da993d63d56d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60bed76893fd7508a86229ff2070995a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=42b23695678ec83e4cfa52b9b20bf7c5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=42b23695678ec83e4cfa52b9b20bf7c5, https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb88b46beab8864ef5593195448e3b01 2x, https://si.imgix.net/94dfdd5b/uploads/origins/1aa3d7d1-7cf8-4d8b-95b2-43d3c441a42d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=473fc70bf519eafe5c1f173397c685b9 3x"}, "body": "Hello, Usushio.\nI was attracted by your very nice illustration on Twitter and sent you a request.\n\nI would like you to draw a fan art of VTuber festsutemari.\nhttps://twitter.com/temari_ayaginu\n\nI would like to ask you to draw a fan art of Atsutte Mari on her birthday on April 30.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw it in a celebratory style!\n\nThe pose, composition, facial expression, etc. are all up to you, but we would appreciate it if you could do it.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could draw it in a festive style.\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FHoHYhXaAAIEQT9?format=jpg&name=medium\nThere is a heart in her eye.\nThere is a crying mole under the left eye.\n\nUsage.\nWe would like to ask for permission to use this image only from Ms. Tetsutsu Temari herself. Use for Twitter, thumbnails for distribution, etc.\n\nOther\nWe would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data that can be layered for people, backgrounds, etc.\n\nThank you in advance for your consideration.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@USUMENO_/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1130888, "client_id": 1547770, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13f2c7d86b474d95e96e12a551c57a87", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13f2c7d86b474d95e96e12a551c57a87, https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52ac4966963de84a5cbb7cf7cde9e023 2x, https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b9be27c9e806d05844fb137b7383224 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f077420355f0d8e16cbf2c94c2e6f12", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f077420355f0d8e16cbf2c94c2e6f12, https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=53d963edc8190d3d61749481ef7dbca5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/912a754c/uploads/origins/c0cc1cc2-7982-4bcb-b89a-a448c4273fa8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1ab9410d1362850805720d3c32fca57c 3x"}, "body": "Please give me an illustration of a fox bride\n\nExpressions She is smiling happily or happily with a shy smile before the wedding.\n(Not limited to the above, as long as the illustration looks happy, I'm happy. Please draw freely.)\n\nFeatures: kemomi (fox ears)\n(It is possible to draw without \"kemomi\" at the discretion of the author. In that case, the notes are written at the bottom)\n\nHair style: I'll leave it up to you.\nHair color: I leave it to you to choose the color of the image of the fox. White fox is also acceptable.\n\nAttire: White kimono\nThe color of the clothes should be white or white with a slight yellowish tinge (the color varies depending on whether it is silk or synthetic fiber).\nThe color of the line of the white kimono (the color of the wiping cloth) The basic white kimono is none, but you may add the trendy red or other colors at your discretion. Please draw freely.\n\nIf possible, please don't use the following items.\nCotton hat (headwear) None (because the hat hides ChemoMimi)\nPossession of red umbrella None (Because it stands out more than the person)\nWearing a mask of a fox None (Because it hides the face. Possession in hand is allowed)\n\nWeather: Rainy (sunny, but raining in some parts) or sunny after rain\nThe author is free to describe the weather or not.\n\nOther ornaments and accessories, composition, background, and resolution are up to you.\nPlease leave the address etc. as it is.\n\nUse\nPersonal use such as PC wallpaper, use in the promotion of fox-related (such as local festivals, limited to non-commercial)\n\nReference URL\nhttps://www.pixivision.net/ja/a/6580\nhttps://www.pixivision.net/ja/a/940\nhttps://www.pixivision.net/ja/a/3340\nhttps://hana-yume.net/howto/shiromuku/\n\nWe support the Inaho Festival (Kitsune no Yomeiri) in Yamaguchi Prefecture.\n\nPlease consider us!\n\nExceptions\nNotes for those without Kemomi\nPlease treat the character as a normal person and use black or brown hair.\n\nSince this is a fox bride, please choose one of the following examples.\nExample 1: No cotton hat. She should have a mask of a fox. Please put it on your hand.\nExample 2: She wears a cotton hat. Make the hat look like a kemomi. Possess a fox mask. Please put it on your hand.\nExample 3: Wearing a cotton hat. No processing of the hat. You have a fox mask. Please put it on your hand.\nPlease see the reference URL for an example of processing a cotton hat into a fox mask.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 336465, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ユネ", "screen_name": "yu_ne_3", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2084670278404304896/9J_6cF8P.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/779840105821315073/1784166197/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 16